    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this customer feedback:\n\n{{ $json.feedback_clean }}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\n{\n  \"sentiment\": \"\",\n  \"sentiment_score\": 0,\n  \"category\": \"\",\n  \"subcategory\": \"\",\n  \"emotion\": \"\",\n  \"root_cause\": \"\",\n  \"priority\": \"\",\n  \"churn_risk\": \"\",\n  \"customer_intent\": \"\",\n  \"summary\": \"\",\n  \"recommendation\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n\nsentiment = Positive, Neutral, or Negative.\n\nsentiment_score = number from 0 to 100.\n\ncategory = Product, Delivery, Customer Support, Pricing, Payment, Website/App, or Other.\n\npriority = Low, Medium, High, or Critical.\n\nchurn_risk = Low, Medium, or High.\n\ncustomer_intent = Complaint, Question, Suggestion, Praise, Request, or Other.\n\nKeep summary and recommendation short.\n\nReturn JSON only.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are an expert Customer Experience Data Analyst.  \n\nAnalyze the customer feedback below.  \n\nCUSTOMER FEEDBACK: \n{{ $json.feedback_clean }}  \n\nYour job is to identify:  \n\n1. Sentiment \n2. Sentiment score \n3. Category \n4. Subcategory \n5. Emotion \n6. Root cause \n7. Priority \n8. Churn risk \n9. Customer intent \n10. Short summary \n11. Business recommendation  \n\nUse these rules.  \n\nSENTIMENT: \n\nPositive \nNeutral \nNegative \n\nSENTIMENT SCORE: \n\n0 = extremely negative \n100 = extremely positive  \n\nCATEGORY: \n\nProduct \nDelivery \nCustomer Support \nPricing \nPayment \nWebsite/App \nOther  \n\nPRIORITY: \n\nLow \nMedium \nHigh \nCritical  \n\nCHURN RISK: \n\nLow \nMedium \nHigh  \n\nCUSTOMER INTENT: \n\nComplaint \nQuestion \nSuggestion \nPraise \nRequest \nOther  \n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.  Use exactly this structure:  \n\n{   \n  \"sentiment\": \"\",   \n  \"sentiment_score\": 0,   \n  \"category\": \"\",   \n  \"subcategory\": \"\",   \n  \"emotion\": \"\",   \n  \"root_cause\": \"\",   \n  \"priority\": \"\",   \n  \"churn_risk\": \"\",   \n  \"customer_intent\": \"\",   \n  \"summary\": \"\",   \n  \"recommendation\": \"\" \n}  \n\nDo not add explanations outside the JSON."
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
