        "message": "=Hello Team,  \n\nA high-risk customer has been detected by the Customer Experience Intelligence system.  \n\nCUSTOMER DETAILS \n---------------- \nCustomer ID: {{ $json.customer_id }} \nCustomer Name: {{ $json.customer_name }} \nProduct: {{ $json.product }} \nRegion: {{ $json.region }}  \n\nCUSTOMER FEEDBACK \n-----------------\n{{ $json.feedback }}  \n\nAI ANALYSIS \n----------- \nSentiment: {{ $json.ai_sentiment }} \nCategory: {{ $json.category }} \nEmotion: {{ $json.emotion }} \nRoot Cause: {{ $json.root_cause }} \nPriority: {{ $json.priority }} \nChurn Risk: {{ $json.churn_risk }}  \n\nBUSINESS RISK \n------------- \nRisk Score: {{ $json.risk_score }}/100 \nRisk Level: {{ $json.risk_level }}  \n\nAI RECOMMENDATION \n----------------- \n{{ $json.recommendation }}  \n\nPlease review this customer case and take appropriate action.  \n\nRegards, \nAI Customer Experience Intelligence System",
